cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite both the journal article and the
  dataset, attributed to their respective authors.
title: "KLCC Parking Occupancy 2022-2024"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license:
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
license-url: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
url: https://mypapit.net
abstract: >-
  Ten-minute parking occupancy series for the KLCC site (site 7, NWD, total
  capacity 5300 bays), derived from raw readings spanning 1 January 2021 to
  31 March 2024, together with the cleaned 10-minute series from 25 April 2022
  and the event, holiday, festive-period and weather series used by the
  accompanying article.
keywords:
  - parking occupancy
  - anomaly detection
  - LSTM autoencoder
  - fault screening
  - time series
  - reproducibility
